'Review seasonal cameras faster, compare activity by time and location and share selected findings without uploading private land imagery to a mandatory cloud service.':'Hitreje preglejte sezonske kamere, primerjajte aktivnost po času in lokaciji ter delite izbrane rezultate brez obveznega nalaganja zasebnih posnetkov v oblak.','Triage field-camera datasets, retain human validation, recover timestamps and export reviewed results into downstream research workflows.':'Razvrstite podatke terenskih kamer, ohranite človeško preverjanje, pridobite časovne oznake in izvozite pregledane rezultate v raziskovalne postopke.','Turn thousands of backyard, forest or reserve camera files into searchable sightings, species timelines and meaningful activity patterns.':'Tisoče posnetkov z vrta, gozda ali rezervata spremenite v iskalne zaznave, časovnice vrst in uporabne vzorce aktivnosti.','Explore hunter workflow →':'Poglej potek za lovce →','Explore research workflow →':'Poglej raziskovalni potek →','Start with Free →':'Začni z brezplačno različico →',
